+**Pitfall:**
+The `GetError` function has a major flaw when sampled points have very similar values, leading to negligible error calculation even if the surface is complex. Fixes suggested: sample more points, use a maximum container size, or sample random points. Uniform grid sampling (corners, midpoints, then in-between) with early break is recommended [S2, unofficial].
 
